{"id":"f09872a0e6f9cd1a","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-recursive-axiomatizability.md","title":"Recursive Axiomatizability","display":"df-recursive-axiomatizability — Recursive Axiomatizability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-recursive-axiomatizability","aliases":["57-df-recursive-axiomatizability"],"display":"df-recursive-axiomatizability — Recursive Axiomatizability","depends_on":["[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-arith0]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-mod]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-recursive-axiomatizability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-recursive-axiomatizability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-axiomatizability — Recursive Axiomatizability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" href=\"?note=ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" title=\"57-df-arith0\">57-df-arith0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f299cb3aecfed079\" href=\"?note=f299cb3aecfed079\" title=\"57-df-mod\">57-df-mod</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为固定有效可数语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[\\Phi]\">\\(g[\\Phi]\\)</span> 为直接像；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" href=\"?note=ffb90a5e7b76ea84\" title=\"57-df-arith0\">57-df-arith0</a> 的自然数集合类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f299cb3aecfed079\" href=\"?note=f299cb3aecfed079\" title=\"57-df-mod\">57-df-mod</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}(T),\\mathrm{RAx}(T),\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}(T),\\mathrm{RAx}(T),\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\)</span> 是下式定义的理论性质谓词，编码环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,g\">\\(L,g\\)</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{RAx}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}\\)</span> 的别名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 使用当前给定的句子公理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(g[\\Phi]\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\land\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)=\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(g[\\Phi]\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\land\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)=\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RecAx}(T),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow g[T]\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RecAx}(T),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow g[T]\\in\\mathrm{RE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>RAx 是 RecAx 的兼容别名。REAx 则描述当前给出的公理集自身的可枚举性，不能把“存在等价的递归公理化”直接当成当前公理集已经有效给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arith0","status":"resolved","id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arith0]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-mod","status":"resolved","id":"f299cb3aecfed079","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-mod]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","status":"resolved","id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为固定有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$g[\\Phi]$ 为直接像；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[57-df-mod]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arith0","status":"resolved","id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为固定有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$g[\\Phi]$ 为直接像；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[57-df-mod]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","status":"resolved","id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为固定有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$g[\\Phi]$ 为直接像；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[57-df-mod]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-mod","status":"resolved","id":"f299cb3aecfed079","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为固定有效可数语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)$。$g[\\Phi]$ 为直接像；$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]。$\\mathrm{Mod}$ 见 [[57-df-mod]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,L)","display":false},{"tex":"g[\\Phi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}(T),\\mathrm{RAx}(T),\\mathrm{REAx}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"L,g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\;\n\\bigl(g[\\Phi]\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\land\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)=\\mathrm{Mod}(T)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RecAx}(T),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{REAx}(T)\\leftrightarrow g[T]\\in\\mathrm{RE}.","display":true}],"bytes":1472,"backlinks":[{"id":"169eff8c77e31e76","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6827c3d062aa9110","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。 $\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]；它要求存在与 $T$ 同模型的递归公理集，而非任意理论都满足。"},{"id":"f967e0a65e70f51b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。 $\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]；它要求存在与 $T$ 同模型的递归公理集，而非任意理论都满足。"},{"id":"8d03cb367dadda8f","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。固定 [[57-df-provability-predicate]] 的同一 $\\mathrm{Bew}_T$ 及其编码，$\\mathrm{RAx}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]；$\\mathrm{HB}_i(T)$ 取 [[57-df-hilbert-bernays-conditions]]。$\\mathrm{Con}_T$ 是下式定义的对象语言句子；元层谓词 $\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 不被当成可放在 $\\vdash$ 右侧的公式。"},{"id":"ce779ac46c7c03fc","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。 $\\mathrm{RecAx}(T)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-axiomatizability]]；它要求存在与 $T$ 同模型的递归公理集，而非任意理论都满足。"},{"id":"077255ba47a9a93e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[5